OL,3,GNEWSASeven dead after police vehicle
OL,4,Aand car crash during pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have died including two
OL,7,Fpolice officers in a crash involving a
OL,8,Fpolice vehicle and a car following a
OL,9,Fpursuit.
OL,11,FThe collision involved a police vehicle
OL,12,Fand a Volkswagen Passat on the A66 in
OL,13,FSouth Bank, near Middlesbrough in
OL,14,FTeesside, at about 03:39 BST, Cleveland
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FNorth East Ambulance Service said 14
OL,18,F"ambulance resources" attended and "a
OL,19,Fnumber of patients died at the scene".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
